<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n86201" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πράσῐν-ος</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">[ᾰ]</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πράσον</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>leek-green, light green,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Mete.</u>
				372a8
			</span></i>, al. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λίθος π.,</span>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρασῖτις</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>Ge.</u>
				2.12
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἱ π.</span>
			<i>the green faction</i> in the Circus, <i><span class="en">
				Mart.
				11.33.1
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>POxy.</u>
				145.2
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(vi A.D.)</span>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ π.</span> (sc.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μέρος</span>) <i><span class="en">
				J.
				<u>AJ</u>
				19.4.4
			</span></i>; cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πράσιος.</span></div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
